            }],
          },
        ],
        hold: {
          ok: true,
          head: 'Rightly silent',
          body: 'Rava taught: she is chullin and her offspring a shelamim — if he slaughtered the chullin mother and then the shelamim calf, he is exempt from lashes. Any cry at the second knife is a warning in doubt, for the blood might never be sprinkled — and an uncertain warning is no warning (81a:13–14).',
        },
