          {
            t: 'afternoon', icon: '🐄',
            text: 'Now he bends over the non-sacred mother, knife at her throat. Nothing about the calf hangs in doubt any more.',
            cries: [{
              label: '📢 Cry the warning!',
              ok: true,
              head: 'The lashes stick!',
              body: "The calf's slaughter was completed and made fit — blood sprinkled, meat permitted. Cutting the mother now is a certain violation of oto v'et beno, so your warning is definite. Rava taught: slaughter the shelamim offspring, sprinkle its blood, then slaughter the chullin mother — he is liable to lashes (81a:15).",
            }],
          },
        ],
        hold: {
          ok: false,
          head: 'He walks free — and the lashes were yours to give',
