      },
      {
        title: 'The Burnt Offering, Before Rava',
        he: 'בְּנָהּ עוֹלָה',
        court: "Rava presiding · in Rabbi Shimon's view",
        cast: '🐮 the calf — an olah (burnt offering, wholly consumed by the altar) · 🐄 the mother — chullin',
